      "title": "README — Reddit 6-Edit One-Shot 검증",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# MiniMax H3 — six edits in one image\n\n## Verified path\n- MiniMax H3 Ref2VA + Turbo LoRA 0.75\n- Community T=1 Image VAE\n- `toobusy MiniMax H3 Image Latent` supplies the one-frame video+audio NestedTensor\n- 8 steps, er_sde, sgm_uniform; verified at 3840×2144 on RTX 3090 24GB\n\n## Before running\n1. Replace `replace_with_your_portrait.png` in Load Image.\n2. Select matching local H3 model, text encoder, LoRA, image VAE, and audio VAE files.\n3. Keep this latent node for still images. Use the official H3 AV latent and video VAE for video.\n\n## Known limits\n- Regular `Empty Latent Image` is not compatible with the H3 video+audio NestedTensor model input.\n- Feeding the T=1 image VAE from a five-frame H3 latent can cause grid/ghosting artifacts.\n- Six requested edits can merge or drift; high output resolution does not guarantee preserved micro-detail."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# MiniMax H3 — six edits in one image\n\n## Verified path\n- MiniMax H3 Ref2VA + Turbo LoRA 0.75\n- Community T=1 Image VAE\n- `toobusy MiniMax H3 Image Latent` supplies the one-frame video+audio NestedTensor\n- 8 steps, er_sde, sgm_uniform; verified at 3840×2144 on RTX 3090 24GB\n\n## Before running\n1. Replace `replace_with_your_portrait.png` in Load Image.\n2. Select matching local H3 model, text encoder, LoRA, image VAE, and audio VAE files.\n3. Keep this latent node for still images. Use the official H3 AV latent and video VAE for video.\n\n## Known limits\n- Regular `Empty Latent Image` is not compatible with the H3 video+audio NestedTensor model input.\n- Feeding the T=1 image VAE from a five-frame H3 latent can cause grid/ghosting artifacts.\n- Six requested edits can merge or drift; high output resolution does not guarantee preserved micro-detail."
      },
